# madcide keybinding profile: JOE/WordStar-style ^K chords (the default,
# owner-directed). One binding per line: key sequence, spaces, action
# name (the LAST word). Sequences are space-separated key spellings, any
# length; letters are case-insensitive (^K S == ^K s). Lines starting
# with # and blank lines are ignored.
^k s save
^k d save
^k x savequit
^k q quit
^c discard
^k b mark
^k y cut
^k c paste
^k f find
^k z undo
^k r check
^k o outline
^k p profile
